* Process:      0.11um Logic and Mixed-Mode 1P8M Metal Metal Capacitor Al Advanced Enhancement Process
* Device Type:  n-ch MOSFET
* Description:  5V Native Device
* Model:        BSIM3 3.24
* Simulator:    HSPICE
* Model features:
*     Global model          : Yes
*     Igate model           : NA
*     Flicker Noise         : Yes
*     LOD model             : NA
*     RF model              : NA
*     Well proximity effect : NA
********************************************************************************        
* Revision history:                 
* <Revision 1>                 
* Version : 0.2 p1                 
* Date    : 2012/10/08                 
* Author  : Wei Lun Hung                
* Remark  : Original release.
********************************************************************************
* Application ranges:
* Geometry range(After 90% shrink):
*
* For Vcc=5V n-ch MOSFET:
*
*        1.988um <= LDES <= 10um
*        1um <= WDES <= 10um
*
* Voltage range:
* 
* For n-ch MOSFET:
*    
*    0V <= VGS <= Vcc(*1.1)
*    0V <= VDS <= Vcc(*1.1)
*  -Vcc <= VBS <= 0V
*
* Temperature range:-40c ~ 125c ; nominal temperature  =  25c
************************************************************************************
**
